VALUES ('430a28f9-477f-5a40-9a5e-61f3d0bc0ed7', '8c82efd4-8578-5019-a689-1904f5c20269', 'e192d14d-f453-5e48-8b77-66aec7638380', 'da02bcaa-3f19-5c78-9684-88f6cba72f22', 'Subscription Number', 'Captures the business meaning of subscription number for the TelecomSubscription. It is interpreted together with the entity''s other attributes and relationships to support the processes that manage this record. Used when creating, reviewing, searching, validating, reporting on, or integrating TelecomSubscription records, where applicable. Its meaning is specific to TelecomSubscription; it must be interpreted with the entity''s relationships, lifecycle, and business rules rather than as an isolated technical value. Required because the business model cannot reliably interpret the record for its declared purpose without this value. Required — the record cannot be saved while this is empty. Must be unique: a save is rejected if another Telecom Subscription already uses this value. Up to 100 characters.', 20, 20, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 'U', TRUE, 'system', 'system', NOW(), NOW())
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
